  "id": "BIT-sqlite-2026-119378",
  "summary": "SQLite before 3.54.0 Use-After-Free in R-Tree nodeWrite()",
  "details": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the R-Tree extension that allows attackers to make applications use freed heap memory by manipulating the %_node shadow table. Attackers can supply a database declaring %_node WITHOUT ROWID or with a RAISE(IGNORE) trigger so nodeWrite() hashes nodes as 0, crashing the process after node splits.",
